// Package errorrender centralized backend user-facing copy (ADR-0017).
//
// This file is the single home for lowercase msg* copy formerly spread
// across per-context message.go/errors.go tables. Each constant is
// byte-identical to its previously inline literal; only the identifier
// and the home moved. Identifiers are globally unique: unique names
// became Msg<Foo>, duplicated names carry a package prefix
// (Msg<PackagePrefix><Foo>). Callers reference errorrender.<Name>.
//
// Wording changes go through the "Backend Copy Vocabulary" table in
// apps/api/CONTEXT.md plus scripts/check-backend-copy.sh; never invent
// copy here. The exported runtimehttp.Msg* kernel envelope table forwards
// here through alias-only consts in its package (see ADR-0017 follow-up).
